t. } 3... cxb6 4. Kg2 4... Kg6 5. Kf1 5... Kf6 { Here the sacrifice sequence breaks down, and your a column never clears. [%cal Rg6f6] }) 3... Kg6 4. a7 4... Kf5 5. a8=Q { A new queen on a8. You gave two pawns away and the third one marched in alone, while his three sat still on b6, c6 and c7. [%csl Ga8] } 1-0


